@ Start

? if: {melodia_q_echo_03_complete} == on

  - Twilight Dancer
    The path no longer asks you to outrun the morning. You found its cadence.

? else:

  ? if: {melodia_q_echo_02_complete} == on

    - Twilight Dancer
      You heard what the grove was trying to say. The last step is not a race.

    - Melusina
      I can carry the half-song without forcing it to become whole.

    $ Notify melodia:quest:melodia_q_echo_03

  ? else:

    - Twilight Dancer
      The morning path waits beyond a constellation still out of tune.

  ? endif

? endif

$ End
